Subject: [PATCH] vesembedded: add experimental Akai S3000XL startup media

Add the S3000XL driver and its selected-device closure, plus generic startup
image options used by VES Phase 1 floppy mounting.

diff --git a/scripts/target/mame/vesembedded.lua b/scripts/target/mame/vesembedded.lua
